TEXT 128 912 Left 2 ;Ground-compatible folded-cascode op-amp: PMOS input pair M32 (+) / M33 (-), NMOS folding M34/M41 + cascodes M35/M40, PMOS cascode mirror load M36-M39, second stage M42 with M43/M44 load, cascode (Ahuja) compensation CA to node F2, source-follower output M45 (L = 0.6u) with ROUT pull-down.
TEXT 0 1000 Left 2 !.include EE4323_cmos.mos
TEXT 0 1040 Left 2 !.include EE4323_bjt.lib
TEXT 1000 1000 Left 2 ;Analyses (one active; the others kept as comments):
TEXT 1000 1040 Left 2 !.op
TEXT 1600 1040 Left 2 ;<- op
TEXT 1000 1076 Left 2 ;.dc VIN 0 2 5m
TEXT 1600 1076 Left 2 ;<- dc
TEXT 1000 1112 Left 2 ;.tran 0 30u 0 2n
TEXT 1600 1112 Left 2 ;<- step
TEXT 0 1200 Left 2 ;Bias sources VDD / VBN / VCN take the values simulated in 02_VREF_Regulator (5 V, 27 C). Unity-gain follower: VIN -> M32 (+), VOUT -> M33 (-).
